Subject: upstream-f7ae8a3a: Ocarina of Time increases the alias region to 8
 GiB (the Chamber of Sages white screen, nxnative #3103)

At the Chamber of Sages transition, SDK 22.2.8 returns 0x1803
for a 50.03 MiB address-region request when no aligned gap fits.
The game keeps presenting a solid white frame.

Give this title 8 GiB of alias space within a 16.5 GiB guest
reservation. The same Mac save and inputs grant the allocation
above the old boundary and reach the Chamber of Sages. The
reporter confirmed the transition on an iPhone 18 Pro.

Verified the Mac host build, unsigned iOS build fixture, and
13 profile and documentation tests. Startup on earlier iPhones
and a full playthrough remain unverified.

Fixes #3103

Co-authored-by: dag294-alt <284773060+dag294-alt@users.noreply.github.com>
